msgid "Layer Z"
msgstr "Kerroksen Z"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7351
msgid ""
"Height of the current layer above the print bed, measured to the top of the "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Nykyisen kerroksen korkeus tulostusalustan yläpuolella, mitattuna kerroksen "
"yläreunaan."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7354
msgid "Maximal layer Z"
msgstr "Suurin kerroksen Z"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7355
msgid "Height of the last layer above the print bed."
msgstr "Viimeisen kerroksen korkeus tulostusalustan yläpuolella."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7358
msgid "Current extruder index"
msgstr "Nykyisen extruderin indeksi"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7359
msgid ""
"Zero-based index of currently used extruder (i.e. first extruder has index "
"0)."
msgstr ""
"Tällä hetkellä käytössä olevan extruderin nollapohjainen indeksi (eli "
"ensimmäisellä extruderilla on indeksi 0)."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7362
msgid "Previous extruder"
msgstr "Edellinen extruder"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7364
msgid ""
"Index of the extruder that is being unloaded. The index is zero based (first "
"extruder has index 0)."
msgstr ""
"Poistettavan extruderin indeksi. Indeksi on nollapohjainen (ensimmäisellä "
"extruderilla on indeksi 0)."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7367
msgid "Next extruder"
msgstr "Seuraava extruder"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7369
msgid ""
"Index of the extruder that is being loaded. The index is zero based (first "
"extruder has index 0)."
msgstr ""
"Ladattavan extruderin indeksi. Indeksi on nollapohjainen (ensimmäisellä "
"extruderilla on indeksi 0)."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7372
msgid "Toolchange Z"
msgstr "Työkalunvaihdon Z"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7374
msgid ""
"Height above the print bed when the toolchange takes place. Usually the same "
"as layer_z, but can be different."
msgstr ""
"Korkeus tulostusalustan yläpuolella, kun työkalunvaihto tapahtuu. Yleensä "
"sama kuin layer_z, mutta voi olla eri."

#. TRN: This is a label in custom g-code editor dialog, belonging to color_change_extruder. Denoted index of the extruder for which color change is performed.
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7378
msgid "Color change extruder"
msgstr "Värinvaihdon extruder"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:7380
msgid ""
"Index of the extruder for which color change will be performed. The index is "
"zero based (first extruder has index 0)."
msgstr ""
"Extruderin indeksi, jolle värinvaihto suoritetaan. Indeksi on nollapohjainen "
"(ensimmäisellä extruderilla on indeksi 0)."

